>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PRINCIPAL-DESCONTO.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VALOR             PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-PERCENTUAL        PIC 9(2)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-DESCONTO          PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-VALOR-FINAL       PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Valor da compra: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-VALOR
    DISPLAY "Percentual de desconto: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-PERCENTUAL

    CALL "CALCULAR-DESCONTO"
        USING WS-VALOR WS-PERCENTUAL WS-DESCONTO WS-VALOR-FINAL
    END-CALL

    DISPLAY "Desconto: " WS-DESCONTO
    DISPLAY "Valor final: " WS-VALOR-FINAL
    GOBACK.
